0:We set sail across the southern sea after our lord commanded us to deal with the mining colony on a nearby island under the control of Bergernstein, a baron who had terrorized our county since the beginning of his reign.||Our ship crashed on the shores of the island we intended to land on. We lost many people in this tragic event, but some of us survived. Now, with no way to turn back, the only path to our survival is to complete the mission we were given.||[$0707FF]Difficulty Rating:[] **||Map uses [$E1FA6B]Strangelove's[] improved AI script.|Map uses [$7A7AEB]Cmowla's[] Anti Lure script (4.3b). 
1:The crew of our ship was comprised of only soldiers and engineers. Due to that we do not have any qualified people who could focus on food production to sustain the needs of our company. We will have to act fast to finish our mission before we run out of limited resources we have in our possession.
2:We noticed a small settlement nearby. We should try capturing it to gain control over food supplies the denizens might be storing. Act fast to defeat the foe before they manage to fill their ranks!
3:The colony took notice of our actions and started preparing to send troops to stop us once and for all. We cannot allow them to succeed, prepare and repel incoming attacks!
4:We looted the fishermen village and took control of their supplies. Well done commander.
